BULK ACCESS / МАССОВЫЙ ДОСТУП
-----------------------------
Bulk data is obtained from the published dump, not through the live API:
Open Food Facts maintainers explicitly ask not to scrape the database via
the API. Live API access in this project is limited to single-barcode
lookups and is confined to one module (openfoodfacts.py).

